            conference: "April 2024 General Conference",
            description: "Cited in this week's manual for Psalm 86 — on turning to God in prayer amid distress, the heart of this week's 'Lord will help me in my time of need' theme.",
            url: "https://www.churchofjesuschrist.org/study/general-conference/2024/04/42porter",
